<h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Post-Quantum Security</h1>
      <p>As quantum computing advances, traditional cryptographic algorithms face eventual obsolescence. MEAICON designs and deploys post-quantum security architectures that protect sensitive data today and against future quantum-capable adversaries. Our approach combines hardware-rooted cryptographic foundations with advanced privacy-preserving techniques including fully homomorphic encryption, multi-party computation, and zero-knowledge proofs.</p>
      <p>We engineer quantum-ready security for organisations across the our region that need long-term data confidentiality and cryptographic agility in a rapidly evolving threat landscape.</p>
